[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14222.63, "timestamp": "03:57:02", "text": "我当时就想，你等等，你在干嘛？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14225.189, "timestamp": "03:57:05", "text": "像你这样经验丰富、处理得非常出色的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14228.469, "timestamp": "03:57:08", "text": "血就像不不不，现在现在我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14231.51, "timestamp": "03:57:11", "text": "当年我第一次接触血液。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14233.429, "timestamp": "03:57:13", "text": "上班那天我晕倒了，因为我看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14235.99, "timestamp": "03:57:15", "text": "血缘关系，我甚至都没处理好。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14238.63, "timestamp": "03:57:18", "text": "我看到血就晕过去了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14240.79, "timestamp": "03:57:20", "text": "“哦，该死。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14244.389, "timestamp": "03:57:24", "text": "真的吗？该死。我不知道这个人是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14247.189, "timestamp": "03:57:27", "text": "“就这样。”然后我就习惯了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14249.03, "timestamp": "03:57:29", "text": "第二天我就习惯了。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14250.63, "timestamp": "03:57:30", "text": "美好的。但就像第一天一样，我做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14253.11, "timestamp": "03:57:33", "text": "处理一下。比如，好吧，嘿，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14256.07, "timestamp": "03:57:36", "text": "还不错吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14258.87, "timestamp": "03:57:38", "text": "所以，是的，这再次令人着迷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14264.15, "timestamp": "03:57:44", "text": "故事又回到了人物身上。我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14266.469, "timestamp": "03:57:46", "text": "想想看，这叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14269.349, "timestamp": "03:57:49", "text": "嗯，外科医生就在附近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14272.63, "timestamp": "03:57:52", "text": "就像有重症监护室之类的医院。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14275.67, "timestamp": "03:57:55", "text": "对，就像我之前说的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14278.87, "timestamp": "03:57:58", "text": "当你看到血并晕倒时，我想知道是不是"}]